  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p001:m0000" ref="62o_3do_q72_A">游明根</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p001:m0005" ref="62o_3do_q72_A">志遠</persName>，廣平任人也。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p002:m0001" ref="62o_3do_q72">幼</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p002:m0003" ref="ec3_1ab_793">馮跋</persName>假廣平太守。和龍平，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-055-youminggen-father:p002:m0015" ref="62o_3do_q72_A">明根</persName>乃得歸鄉里。</p>
</text>
